Kraken Context 4: own Transformer, trained from random initialization.
No pretrained model weights or pretrained tokenizer were imported.

Architecture: 15,363,840 parameters, 6 layers, width 384, 6 attention heads,
512-token context, own BPE tokenizer (8192 entries).

